      short: 'Three adventure dives in one day. Halfway to Advanced.',
      title: 'PADI Adventure Diver Koh Kood | 3 Adventure Dives in 1 Day',
      desc: 'PADI Adventure Diver in Koh Kood: three adventure dives — deep, navigation and one of your choice — completed in one day. 11,500 THB, everything included.',
